; Minimal v1 executable-plugin manifest: one expr-func `(double n)` whose
; body is supplied by the paired `double.wasm` binary's `double` export.
; Used by host-side conformance (cases 100-…) and by `host.test.ts` +
; `tests/host.rs` to exercise the ABI end-to-end with a tiny artifact.

(plugin :name double :version "1.0.0"
  (expr-func :name double
    :arity (fixed 1)
    :params [number]
    :result number
    :impl "wasm:double"))
